# Copy to .env (or .env.local). Neither is needed for local development.
# The voice server's WebSocket, e.g. wss://api.example.com or a tunnel to localhost:3001.
# VITE_WS_URL=
# The voice server's HTTP address for the résumé upload, e.g. https://api.example.com. Leave empty to use the
# Vite proxy (development). On another origin, add this page's origin to CORS_ORIGINS in the server's .env.
# VITE_API_URL=
